@startuml Sequence Diagram - Download Document

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "KnowledgeDocumentView" as DocView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> DocView : 1 Open documents list page
activate DocView
DocView -> DocView : 2 Display documents list

Admin -> DocView : 3 Select document to download
Admin -> DocView : 4 Click "Download" button

DocView -> ClerkAuth : 5 Request document file
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 6 Fetch document file
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 7 Retrieve document file
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 8 Return file
ClerkAuth -> DocView : 9 Return file
DocView -> Admin : 10 Download document

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate DocView

@enduml
